{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cu1","name":"新标点和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CU1","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"1f0247773be3712e994ac4eccb3b624b101fa6fae60aa587349845096ad56a19","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"1JN","translationId":"cmn_cu1","name":"约翰一书","commonName":"约翰一书","title":"约翰一书","order":62,"numberOfChapters":5,"sha256":"c4344e8b63e4b18418b0e61d0e077d3017b16dadff1a8d9f37661cff7c6a58c4","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/1JN/1.json","lastChapterNumber":5,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/1JN/5.json","totalNumberOfVerses":105},"chapter":{"number":1,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["生命之道"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["论到从起初原有的生命之道，就是我们所听见、所看见、亲眼看过、亲手摸过的。（"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["这生命已经显现出来，我们也看见过，现在又作见证，将原与父同在、且显现与我们那永远的生命传给你们。）"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["我们将所看见、所听见的传给你们，使你们与我们相交。我们乃是与父并他儿子耶稣基督相交的。"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["我们将这些话写给你们，使你们",{"noteId":0},"的喜乐充足。"]},{"type":"heading","content":["神就是光"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["神就是光，在他毫无黑暗。这是我们从主所听见、又报给你们的信息。"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["我们若说是与 神相交，却仍在黑暗里行，就是说谎话，不行真理了。"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["我们若在光明中行，如同 神在光明中，就彼此相交，他儿子耶稣的血也洗净我们一切的罪。"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["我们若说自己无罪，便是自欺，真理不在我们心里了。"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["我们若认自己的罪， 神是信实的，是公义的，必要赦免我们的罪，洗净我们一切的不义。"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["我们若说自己没有犯过罪，便是以 神为说谎的，他的道也不在我们心里了。"]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":0,"caller":"-","text":"有古卷：我们","reference":{"chapter":1,"verse":4}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/1JN/1.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/1JN/2.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/2PE/3.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":10}